/* ═══ 9. BOWED — the sustained string ══════════════════════════════════════
   The bow is played, not switched: pressure and speed have their own contour,
   a real attack scratches before it catches, and vibrato is a finger moving,
   so it bends pitch and rides in gradually rather than being on from sample
   zero.                                                                      */
