/* ── the solo ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
   Four six-pulse cells per cycle. The sequence is drawn fresh EVERY cycle —
   that is the point of a soloist, and it is the one voice in the room allowed
   to do it. Density follows tension; the last cell of a cycle must be one
   that closes. */
